---
// Why an UPCoM stock can close green yet open tomorrow with a lower reference price:
// HOSE/HNX use last matched price; UPCoM uses the session's weighted-average price.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';

const W = 900;
const H = 310;
---
<figure class="sbp2-upcom">
  <div class="sbp2-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Comparison showing a stock that trades 9,000 shares at 19,500 VND all morning and 1,000 shares at 21,000 VND at the close: on HOSE tomorrow's reference is 21,000, while on UPCoM tomorrow's reference is the weighted average 19,650, rounded to 19,700 VND.">
      <text x="20" y="30" class="sbp2-title">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Same day's trades, two different reference prices tomorrow</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Cùng một ngày giao dịch, hai giá tham chiếu khác nhau vào ngày mai</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Left: the intraday trades */}
      <rect x="20" y="54" width="380" height="226" rx="10" class="sbp2-box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="chart" x={48} y={84} size={24} />
      <text x="72" y="89" class="sbp2-hdr">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Today's matched trades</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Các lệnh đã khớp hôm nay</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="40" y="130" class="sbp2-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Morning (9,000 shares): 19,500 VND</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Buổi sáng (9.000 CP): 19.500 đồng</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="40" y="160" class="sbp2-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Late afternoon (1,000 shares): 21,000 VND</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Cuối chiều (1.000 CP): 21.000 đồng</tspan>
      </text>
      <line x1="40" y1="184" x2="380" y2="184" class="sbp2-sep" />
      <text x="40" y="214" class="sbp2-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Last match (closing print): 21,000 VND</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Giá khớp cuối phiên: 21.000 đồng</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="40" y="242" class="sbp2-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Weighted average: 19,650 VND → 19,700 tick</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Bình quân gia quyền: 19.650 → làm tròn 19.700</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Arrows to HOSE vs UPCoM */}
      <line x1="408" y1="120" x2="486" y2="108" class="sbp2-arrow" />
      <polygon points="494,107 484,103 485,113" class="sbp2-head" />

      <line x1="408" y1="210" x2="486" y2="222" class="sbp2-arrow fm-flow" />
      <polygon points="494,223 485,217 484,227" class="sbp2-head" />

      {/* Top right: HOSE / HNX */}
      <rect x="502" y="54" width="378" height="102" rx="10" class="sbp2-box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="ok" x={530} y={84} size={24} />
      <text x="554" y="89" class="sbp2-hdr">HOSE / HNX</text>
      <text x="860" y="89" text-anchor="end" class="sbp2-big">21,000</text>
      <text x="522" y="128" class="sbp2-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Tomorrow's reference = today's last matched price</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tham chiếu ngày mai = giá đóng cửa hôm nay</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Bottom right: UPCoM */}
      <rect x="502" y="178" width="378" height="102" rx="10" class="sbp2-box sbp2-box-red" />
      <DiagramIcon name="warning" x={530} y={208} size={24} />
      <text x="554" y="213" class="sbp2-hdr sbp2-red">UPCoM</text>
      <text x="860" y="213" text-anchor="end" class="sbp2-big sbp2-red">19,700</text>
      <text x="522" y="252" class="sbp2-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Reference = weighted average, rounded to 100 VND</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tham chiếu = bình quân gia quyền, làm tròn bước 100 đ</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Why a green close on UPCoM can surprise beginners the next morning: one small late trade moves the last price to 21,000 VND, while the bulk of volume at 19,500 VND anchors tomorrow's reference price down at 19,700 VND.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Vì sao một mã UPCoM đóng cửa xanh rì vẫn có thể khiến người mới giật mình sáng hôm sau: vài lệnh cuối ngày kéo giá khớp cuối lên 21.000, nhưng 90% khối lượng khớp buổi sáng ở 19.500 kéo giá tham chiếu ngày mai về 19.700 đồng.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .sbp2-upcom { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sbp2-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .sbp2-upcom svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .sbp2-upcom text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .sbp2-title { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp2-box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .sbp2-box-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp2-hdr { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp2-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .sbp2-big { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp2-body { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .sbp2-sub { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp2-sep { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .sbp2-arrow { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .sbp2-head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp2-upcom figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
